      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "READY FOR THIS (8) has a superb record at this track and trip, unbeaten so far from three starts. Recorded a 0.8 lengths win (20.02) in a Grade 5 last time at this track. With a clean break looks hard to beat. NANGAR WALLY (7) ran a slick 25.18 when filling a minor placing over 457m at Q Lakeside last start. This is tougher but expected to be in the finish. BLACK RASPBERRY (2) wasn't far away at the finish when 4th and beaten only 4.5 lengths (25.68) at Q Lakeside. Form here at the trip sound including 10 wins. The form from his last run is stacking up nicely. Likely to play a prominent role. VERMENTINO (4) must be respected at his pet distance.",
